{"schemaVersion":1,"code":"G1-02","example":{"issue":{"title":"主次道路相接，停讓關係是否清楚？","intro":"主要道路約 6 m、次要道路約 4.5 m，路側無人行設施。","images":[{"key":"results:g1-02-diagram-1","label":"現況圖","role":"diagram","rotation":0},{"key":"results:g1-02-photo-1","label":"現況照片","role":"photo","rotation":0},{"key":"results:g1-02-photo-2","label":"現況照片 2","role":"photo","rotation":0}],"items":[{"id":"priority","title":"缺少停讓管制","text":"主次道路未設清楚的管制設施，駕駛容易忽略停讓。"},{"id":"speed","title":"速限提示不足","text":"兩條道路皆缺少速限標字與標誌，行駛速度不易掌握。"}],"photoStatus":"available"},"sourceSlides":[41,42],"strategy":{"title":"先看見路口，再清楚停讓","intro":"以停讓管制、速限預告與行車導引，讓鄉區路口更容易辨識。","images":[{"key":"results:g1-02-strategy","label":"整體佈設圖","rotation":0}],"items":[{"id":"priority","title":"明確次要道路停讓","text":"搭配停車再開標誌、停止線與「停」標字，說清楚停讓位置。","moduleId":"M2-01"},{"id":"warning","title":"提前提醒路口與速限","text":"以岔路標誌、速限標誌與減速提示，提醒駕駛接近路口。","moduleId":"M4-01"},{"id":"path","title":"畫清車行範圍","text":"以分向與行車導引線銜接路口，配合大型車轉向調整停止位置。","moduleId":"M1-01"}]},"strategySource":{"file":"chapters/04-general-scenarios/04-1-02-unsignalized-rural-orthogonal-t.typ","sha256":"d60fbbb6aad55342c7dea762bbf542d3d22160a39ad5b149fc42c72b511971e5","section":"交通設施設置建議與整體設置圖例","figureNote":"使用G1-02_無號誌鄉區正交三叉路口設施設置圖例.svg。"}},"assets":{"results:g1-02-diagram-1":{"file":"materials/04-一般道路情境/current-conditions/G1-02/G1-02_現況圖_01.png","width":1872,"height":1281,"label":"G1-02 現況圖","scenario":"G1-02","role":"diagram","rotation":0,"sourceSlide":41,"sourcePart":"ppt/media/image28.png","sha256":"bb4974b6e1f16e3867ef3ddb4ce18099a9116dc9421e878fe992af3c2fe55132"},"results:g1-02-photo-1":{"file":"materials/04-一般道路情境/current-conditions/G1-02/G1-02_現況照片_01.png","width":2615,"height":1388,"label":"G1-02 現況照片","scenario":"G1-02","role":"photo","rotation":0,"sourceSlide":42,"sourcePart":"ppt/media/image30.png","sha256":"e806ec69729b5cb552cb284bfb1a37abb99e56ede4b5e93ebff18fc640868b89"},"results:g1-02-photo-2":{"file":"materials/04-一般道路情境/current-conditions/G1-02/G1-02_現況照片_02.png","width"